_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All C(H,H,H) groups
2. Rigid body (RIGU) restrains
 C009, N007, C00A, C00H, C00C, C00G, C00F, C00I, C00D, C00B, C00E, C00J, C00L,
 C00K, N8, C17, C14, C15
 with sigma for 1-2 distances of 0.004 and sigma for 1-3 distances of 0.004
3.a Ternary CH refined with riding coordinates:
 C00A(H00H), C00J(H00P)
3.b Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C00C(H00D), C00F(H00F), C00D(H00E), C00I(H00I), C00G(H00G), C00L(H00M),
 C14(H14), C15(H15), C00K(H00N), C00E(H00O)
3.c Fitted hexagon refined as free rotating group:
 C009(C00C,C00F,C00D,C00I,C00G), C00B(C00L,C14,C15,C00K,C00E)
3.d Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 N007(H00A,H00B,H00C), C00H(H00J,H00K,H00L), N8(H8A,H8B,H8C), C17(H17A,H17B,
 H17C)
